{
 "events": [
  {
   "id": "COLD",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 0.0,
   "end": 2.7
  },
  {
   "id": "N1",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 2.9,
   "end": 9.494,
   "text": "At 7:25 AM, November 6th, I was watching videos on my phone... when an unknown number texted me."
  },
  {
   "id": "U1",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 9.824,
   "end": 14.164,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     9.824,
     "At midnight, the world ends."
    ],
    [
     11.774,
     "Do exactly what I say, and you'll live."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N2",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 14.514,
   "end": 17.072,
   "text": "I thought it was a prank. Then it texted again."
  },
  {
   "id": "U2",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 17.502,
   "end": 20.412,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     17.502,
     "There's a pizza and a chair in your fridge."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N3",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 21.412,
   "end": 29.052,
   "text": "I checked. There was a pizza... and a chair... inside my fridge. How did it know that? I was home alone."
  },
  {
   "id": "U3",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 30.582,
   "end": 36.102,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     30.582,
     "Don't go to school today."
    ],
    [
     32.142,
     "Buy water, canned food, batteries."
    ],
    [
     34.752,
     "Go. NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H1",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 36.352,
   "end": 37.582,
   "text": "who is this??"
  },
  {
   "id": "U4",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 37.862,
   "end": 39.752,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     37.862,
     "No time."
    ],
    [
     38.922,
     "Trust me."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N4",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 40.202,
   "end": 46.693,
   "text": "So I went. The store was empty. The cashier kept coughing. And his eyes... were yellow."
  },
  {
   "id": "JS1",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 46.793,
   "end": 48.493
  },
  {
   "id": "U5",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 48.623,
   "end": 53.483,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     48.623,
     "Don't touch him."
    ],
    [
     49.733,
     "Go home."
    ],
    [
     50.693,
     "Lock your door at exactly 11:58."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N5",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 53.933,
   "end": 56.25,
   "text": "11:58. I locked the door."
  },
  {
   "id": "N6",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 56.75,
   "end": 61.01,
   "text": "11:59. Every phone in the city started screaming."
  },
  {
   "id": "N7",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 61.46,
   "end": 63.329,
   "text": "Then the real screaming started."
  },
  {
   "id": "U6",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 64.759,
   "end": 69.519,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     64.759,
     "RULE 1: Don't open the door. For anyone."
    ],
    [
     68.069,
     "Not even people you know."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N8",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 70.069,
   "end": 76.22,
   "text": "Day 3. Someone knocked. It was Mr. Hale, my neighbor. He was begging me to let him in."
  },
  {
   "id": "N9",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 76.72,
   "end": 80.498,
   "text": "My hand was already on the lock... when my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U7",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 81.078,
   "end": 81.648,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     81.078,
     "Don't."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N10",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 82.648,
   "end": 86.274,
   "text": "I didn't open it. 10 seconds later, he stopped begging."
  },
  {
   "id": "JS2",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 86.374,
   "end": 88.574
  },
  {
   "id": "N10b",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 88.674,
   "end": 90.17,
   "text": "And started scratching."
  },
  {
   "id": "U8",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 91.6,
   "end": 95.51,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     91.6,
     "RULE 2: The roof. 3 AM."
    ],
    [
     94.61,
     "Come alone."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N11",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 96.01,
   "end": 103.128,
   "text": "3 AM. Something was buzzing over the city. A drone. It dropped a box, right at my feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "N12",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 103.628,
   "end": 111.902,
   "text": "Inside: a radio, a flashlight, and a map. One place was circled in red. The bridge. Day 30."
  },
  {
   "id": "N13",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 112.802,
   "end": 114.772,
   "text": "Day 12. The power died."
  },
  {
   "id": "U9",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 116.202,
   "end": 119.662,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     116.202,
     "RULE 3: They're drawn to light."
    ],
    [
     118.452,
     "Keep the curtains shut."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N14",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 120.062,
   "end": 125.604,
   "text": "Across the street, someone turned on a flashlight. 30 seconds later... it went out."
  },
  {
   "id": "N15",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 126.504,
   "end": 132.834,
   "text": "Day 18. Trucks. Men in white suits, with a logo I'd never seen before."
  },
  {
   "id": "N16",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 133.284,
   "end": 136.735,
   "text": "They weren't killing the zombies. They were collecting them."
  },
  {
   "id": "N17",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 137.235,
   "end": 140.206,
   "text": "Then one of them looked up. Right at my window."
  },
  {
   "id": "U10",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 140.536,
   "end": 142.196,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     140.536,
     "GET DOWN."
    ],
    [
     141.516,
     "NOW."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N18",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 143.196,
   "end": 145.707,
   "text": "Day 23. I had to ask."
  },
  {
   "id": "H2",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 146.057,
   "end": 147.887,
   "text": "why are you helping me?"
  },
  {
   "id": "U11",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 148.317,
   "end": 149.447,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     148.317,
     "Because I owe you."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "H3",
   "kind": "H",
   "t": 149.697,
   "end": 150.807,
   "text": "who ARE you"
  },
  {
   "id": "U12",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 151.437,
   "end": 154.237,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     151.437,
     "You used to be scared of thunder."
    ],
    [
     153.267,
     "You still are."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "JS3",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 154.237,
   "end": 155.837
  },
  {
   "id": "N19",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 156.087,
   "end": 158.951,
   "text": "How did they know that? Nobody knew that."
  },
  {
   "id": "U13",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 160.081,
   "end": 165.341,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     160.081,
     "Tomorrow. 6 AM."
    ],
    [
     162.241,
     "Get to the bridge."
    ],
    [
     163.111,
     "Don't stop. Don't look back."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "N20",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 165.741,
   "end": 167.704,
   "text": "My phone was at 1%."
  },
  {
   "id": "N21",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 168.604,
   "end": 174.427,
   "text": "Day 30. I ran. I didn't stop. And they heard every single step."
  },
  {
   "id": "N22",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 174.927,
   "end": 178.633,
   "text": "I made it to the bridge. It was empty. Nobody was there."
  },
  {
   "id": "N23",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 179.233,
   "end": 180.542,
   "text": "Then my phone buzzed."
  },
  {
   "id": "U14",
   "kind": "U",
   "t": 181.172,
   "end": 182.662,
   "bubbles": [
    [
     181.172,
     "Turn around."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "JS4",
   "kind": "S",
   "t": 182.662,
   "end": 186.862
  },
  {
   "id": "N24",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 186.962,
   "end": 189.952,
   "text": "Behind me... was a man in a white suit."
  },
  {
   "id": "N25",
   "kind": "N",
   "t": 191.452,
   "end": 195.511,
   "text": "Who is the unknown number? Comment your guess. Follow for part 2."
  }
 ],
 "story_end": 195.911,
